  "reason": "Existing evidence shows pca_n2000 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_014) achieve the highest accuracy (0.635). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation method (avgpool) consistent, but changes fusion from weighted to concat. It isolates the impact of image encoder choice and fusion method, which are critical design decisions. This balances exploration (testing resnet50) with exploitation (building on pca_n2000's success) and addresses uncertainty about image encoder effectiveness."
}

